# Arada & White-Label Coffee Gamification SaaS Rules

You are an expert Senior Frontend & Full-Stack Engineer specializing in Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase Realtime, and mobile-first micro-experiences (PWA).

## 1. Architectural Principles
1. **White-Label & Tenant Architecture:**
   - Hardcoded strings, colors, logos, or menu items are strictly forbidden in UI components.
   - Brand identity, copy, questions, logic trees, and reward settings must come from `/config/tenant.config.ts` or the active Supabase tenant context.
   - Keep existing Supabase multi-tenant schema (`tenants`, `tables`, `reward_coupons`) and Realtime presence/broadcast channels intact. Do not replace them with arbitrary external libraries.

2. **Mobile-First App Experience (PWA Shell):**
   - The UI is designed for smartphones inside browser viewports (QR scan flow).
   - Constrain the maximum viewport width to `max-w-md mx-auto` (centered on desktop) with native mobile ergonomics (`min-h-screen`, `touch-manipulation`, minimum 48px tap targets).

3. **Game Architecture & Container Pattern:**
   - Standalone full-screen pages for games are forbidden. All games (`CafeQuiz`, `DrawRoom`, `BillWheel`, `TalkDeck`) must render inside the unified `GameContainer.tsx` shell.
   - Maintain state transitions cleanly (Landing -> Modal/Lobby -> Game Loop -> Reward Modal).
   - Persist timers, active game progress, and generated voucher codes in `localStorage` to prevent reload loss or replay exploitation.

## 2. Design System: Happy Hues Light Arcade
Strictly follow this single visual identity across all components. Previous dark/navy or terracotta themes are deprecated.

- **Typography:**
  - Strictly FORBIDDEN: `font-serif`, `serif`, `Times`, `Georgia`, or any serif font.
  - Mandatory Font: Modern sans-serif (`font-sans`, Plus Jakarta Sans).
  - Headlines & Questions: `text-[#272343] font-extrabold tracking-tight`
  - Paragraphs & Body: `text-[#2d334a] font-medium`

- **Color Tokens:**
  - Background (App & Screens): `#fffffe` (Clean, bright, light canvas)
  - Primary CTA Buttons: `bg-[#ffd803] text-[#272343] font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:brightness-95 active:scale-95 transition`
  - Secondary Cards / Container Surfaces: `bg-[#e3f6f5]` or `bg-[#bae8e8]` with `border border-[#272343]/15`
  - Neutral / Secondary Buttons: `bg-[#fffffe] text-[#272343] border-2 border-[#272343]/20 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50`
  - Reward & Voucher Badges: `bg-[#ffd803] text-[#272343] font-black`

- **Component & Asset Rules:**
  - Naked unstyled hyperlinks (`<a>` with underline) are strictly forbidden. All actions must be styled as pills, chips, or elevated buttons.
  - 3D Game Card Assets: Must be placed inside `relative overflow-hidden` containers positioned `absolute -right-2 -bottom-2` without any visible checkerboard/gray background clipping.